# @auki/$crate_package_name

wasm-bindgen JavaScript bindings for `auki-manifests`.

```js
import init, { buildDetectionLogManifestJson } from "./$generated_js_file";

await init();
const manifest = JSON.parse(buildDetectionLogManifestJson(
  "boosterapp",
  "session-1",
  "aukilabs/qr/v1",
  "detectorhash",
  "input-log",
  "K1/head",
  "sensorhash",
  "K1/utc",
  "clockhash",
  1000000000n,
  30000000000n,
));
```

The package exposes JCS-canonical JSON-string adapters over the same binding-free manifest builders used by Rust.
